.Dd July 9, 2026
.Dt IMPORTCTL 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm importctl
.Nd import a document into a WordPress page
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl f Ar format
.Op Fl n
.Ar input
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm importctl
command converts
.Ar input
into portable blocks and writes media beside the document.
.Bl -bullet
.It
Use
.Fl f
to select a source format.
.It
Use
.Fl n
to omit images.
.El
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Cm verify
Check the generated HTML and block markup.
.It Pa /tmp/imports
Default directory for conversion artifacts.
.El